From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 17:31:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 23/29] Mobile: Harden the shopping lists for the app runtime

The relay client takes the WebSocket constructor as a parameter instead
of falling back to a Node-only require that Metro would bundle; a small
TextEncoder/TextDecoder polyfill covers Hermes builds without them;
category changes are published like other edits; lists can be left;
the foreground refresh no longer touches the database before a list
exists. Verified with a Metro release bundle.

